function visionView(){return head('THE VISION','Transform With Me.','A practical accountability mission built around showing up consistently, working at your own level and continuing forward.')+`<section class="form narrow"><div class="video-placeholder"><p class="eyebrow">THE TRANSFORM WITH ME VISION</p><h2>Video coming soon.</h2><p>Hamish will share the mission behind Transform With Me here.</p></div><h3>Start where you are.</h3><p>Transform is designed around consistent action rather than perfection. The 28-workout sequence is cyclical: participate in the way that fits you, record what you do, and keep moving forward.</p><p>It is an accountability platform, not personal coaching or a promise of a particular result.</p><button id="vision-join">Join Transform With Me</button></section>`}
